WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.071
The Internet,

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:07.974
a place with endless possibilities

00:00:07.974 --> 00:00:10.710
and all sorts of content

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.712
happy memories,

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:14.681
new arrivals,

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:20.220
DIY, lots of food, good and all.

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.722
Just adorable.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:24.257
But in the midst of the joy,

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.559
there is also darkness.

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:27.794
Personal information

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.863
is rife in the digital world.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.532
And if yours is ever maliciously divulged

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.967
without your consent.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:36.002
Well, that's doxing

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.107
doxing derives

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:43.243
from the word docs or documents,

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:45.478
and it comes from the hacking culture

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:47.080
of dropping documents.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:51.851
It's sharing someone's information online

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:53.553
without their consent

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:54.320
and often

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.323
with the malicious intent to attack them.

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.858
And undermine them.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.027
That could include, for example,

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:02.028
sharing someone's

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:02.962
home, address

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:04.831
the financial information,

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.099
telephone number,

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:09.803
intimate photos, private photos.

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:11.905
To find that information, doctors

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.173
might go through search

00:01:13.173 --> 00:01:15.275
engines, social media histories,

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:17.444
or data broker websites.

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:19.646
And in some cases they hack.

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:22.882
Once the information is collected,

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:25.051
doctors post the content with the intent

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:27.120
of violating the victim's privacy

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.022
and harming them.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:31.324
And when it comes to targeting women,

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:32.459
the content is often

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:35.762
sexually abusive in nature.

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:38.898
Doxing is more dangerous and egregious

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.400
for women than men

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.269
because of patriarchal norms.

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:45.805
If you see a topless man,

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:46.806
it's not the same way

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:48.908
of seeing a topless picture of a woman.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:51.845
They take to a different dimensions

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:52.512
because, you know,

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:55.315
society dictates that this is okay

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:56.783
and this is not okay.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:58.084
And boxers play on this.

00:01:58.084 --> 00:01:58.952
To us,

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:00.887
the effects are also not felt

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.456
equally across the world.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.126
A 2020 economist intelligence unit report

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:06.726
showed that

00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:07.727
although online

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:08.828
violence against women

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:11.164
is common globally,

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:13.066
at least 90% of respondents

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:15.702
in Latin America and the Caribbean Africa

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.837
and the Middle East had been affected

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:22.242
it started in

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:23.676
2019 when

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.778
said just the initials of my name.

00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:28.748
To say that this kind of women

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:29.883
wants to ruin

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:33.987
our morals wants to ruin our religion.

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:36.623
Karima Nadir is a human rights

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:38.424
advocate in Morocco.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:39.692
She says she endured

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:42.028
a yearlong defamation campaign

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:44.330
in the form of many online articles

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.398
and in tandem.

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:47.934
Karima was also doxed.

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.469
In the midst of the lies

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:50.870
true personal information

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:53.306
was published online without her consent.

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:59.279
In 20, 20, it goes to calling me a whore,

00:02:59.579 --> 00:03:01.314
a person that speaks with everybody

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.016
that had sex for money.

00:03:03.016 --> 00:03:05.585
They were like mentioning the city

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:08.221
and the neighbor that I was living in.

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:10.156
And after that,

00:03:10.156 --> 00:03:12.992
it went far to even discuss

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:16.596
my right of being a mom that ended up

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:18.264
by publishing

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:20.433
the birth certificate of my son.

00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:23.236
So I've decided to change my my home

00:03:23.503 --> 00:03:26.272
and to to go and live in another neighbor

00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:29.842
when women

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:31.377
are being blocked, often

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:33.780
there is a narrative spin,

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.082
a web of disinformation and lies

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:40.320
in order to smear a woman's reputation

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.489
and effectively silence her.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.725
I had

00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:49.462
many messages on my spam on Facebook,

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.030
and at first,

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.031
because of the shock,

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:54.567
I started suspecting people around me.

00:03:55.435 --> 00:03:58.304
I was just in my room and closing

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:00.707
the door and trying for hours

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:05.311
Doxing takes a cultural dimension.

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:06.713
For example,

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.248
a woman's picture

00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:09.482
without a veil

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:11.050
can be shared on social media.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:12.418
And when you look at the photo itself,

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:13.953
it's very benign, is very innocent,

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:15.655
and doesn't really violate

00:04:15.655 --> 00:04:17.824
the platform's terms of services.

00:04:17.824 --> 00:04:19.459
But looking at the social

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:20.760
and cultural context

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.228
in which this doxing is taking

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:24.631
place can be very dangerous and life

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:25.798
threatening to this woman

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:33.973
or somebody posted a photo of me

00:04:33.973 --> 00:04:36.075
and somebody else on Twitter

00:04:36.075 --> 00:04:38.244
with a caption saying

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:39.812
These are two lesbians

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:41.614
who have started a nonsense

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:43.383
agenda in Ghana.

00:04:43.383 --> 00:04:46.019
Take a good look at their faces

00:04:46.019 --> 00:04:46.653
in activist

00:04:46.653 --> 00:04:47.820
Fatima Darby's case,

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.822
the weapon of choice was a photo

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:51.090
as Fatima

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.692
shared a picture of her solo

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:55.295
supporting LGBTQ rights in Ghana.

00:04:56.162 --> 00:04:57.597
She and the friend

00:04:57.597 --> 00:04:58.831
she tagged as the photographer

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:00.400
got attacked.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.301
The docs are combed

00:05:01.301 --> 00:05:01.901
through Fatima's

00:05:01.901 --> 00:05:02.902
friend's Twitter

00:05:02.902 --> 00:05:04.971
and posted a picture of both of them

00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:06.673
in a comment.

00:05:06.673 --> 00:05:08.408
The attacker invited others

00:05:08.408 --> 00:05:11.210
to share their names and addresses

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:12.712
because I was finding in my palms

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:14.947
with sweaty and light, my head

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:16.516
feel hot in my hands.

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:17.884
It's probably because I'm like,

00:05:17.884 --> 00:05:18.751
What is this?

00:05:18.751 --> 00:05:19.886
What would I do

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:20.353
if somebody's

00:05:20.353 --> 00:05:22.422
going to show up at my gigs?

00:05:22.422 --> 00:05:25.358
I also felt a lot of guilt because I felt

00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:27.160
that I had put somebody else

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.395
in a compromising situation

00:05:29.395 --> 00:05:31.864
because not random people were people

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:33.966
have not heard of like in years

00:05:33.966 --> 00:05:35.234
messaged me saying he asked,

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:36.669
what is false? Is it true?

00:05:36.669 --> 00:05:37.470
Are you a lesbian?

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:38.304
You know, that kind of thing.

00:05:38.304 --> 00:05:38.971
And it's like,

00:05:38.971 --> 00:05:40.340
So if I am a lesbian, does

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.408
it mean that I deserve this?

00:05:42.408 --> 00:05:43.142
But it was all

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:45.545
but I can sense of helplessness.

00:05:45.545 --> 00:05:47.347
Like, I'm reporting to Twitter

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:48.281
not doing anything

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:51.884
The feedback I got

00:05:51.884 --> 00:05:52.385
was them

00:05:52.385 --> 00:05:53.619
saying that they did

00:05:53.619 --> 00:05:54.420
find that

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.254
that post

00:05:55.254 --> 00:05:57.657
was in violation of any of their laws.

00:05:57.657 --> 00:05:59.625
But in giving the context,

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:02.061
giving the increasing violence

00:06:02.462 --> 00:06:04.097
that LGBT people in Ghana

00:06:04.097 --> 00:06:06.132
would face, and especially at the time,

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:06.366
because that

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:07.500
was extremely dangerous,

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.469
extremely violent

00:06:10.169 --> 00:06:11.104
Two days later,

00:06:11.104 --> 00:06:13.272
Twitter took down the post.

00:06:13.272 --> 00:06:14.073
This was after

00:06:14.073 --> 00:06:15.808
Fatima contested their decision

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:17.677
and was asked to provide context

00:06:17.677 --> 00:06:21.280
as to why the Post should not stay up

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:23.449
for days, including the House

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.151
when I had to go outside.

00:06:25.151 --> 00:06:26.919
Like I was wearing sunglasses

00:06:26.919 --> 00:06:28.254
and in those masks

00:06:28.254 --> 00:06:29.655
I had to change my hair

00:06:29.655 --> 00:06:29.889
you know,

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:32.725
just do everything to not be recognized.

00:06:33.593 --> 00:06:35.828
It created a sense of safety.

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:37.764
You don't know who is watching.

00:06:37.764 --> 00:06:39.399
It was a harrowing experience

00:06:42.869 --> 00:06:44.270
on social media,

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:44.837
and the

00:06:44.837 --> 00:06:46.172
reporting mechanisms

00:06:46.172 --> 00:06:46.973
for users

00:06:46.973 --> 00:06:49.375
are unfortunately not sufficient.

00:06:50.676 --> 00:06:51.878
There is also the question

00:06:51.878 --> 00:06:53.146
of jurisdictions

00:06:53.146 --> 00:06:54.647
and how each

00:06:54.647 --> 00:06:58.050
country might look at the act of doxing,

00:06:58.351 --> 00:06:59.919
noting that in many countries,

00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:03.122
unfortunately, doxing is not illegal

00:07:04.157 --> 00:07:05.925
for adults.

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:09.262
Victim is blamed for being guilty

00:07:09.328 --> 00:07:10.730
or responsible.

00:07:10.730 --> 00:07:12.732
It's the same thing as blaming

00:07:13.433 --> 00:07:15.001
sexual assault victims

00:07:15.001 --> 00:07:16.369
of being responsible

00:07:16.369 --> 00:07:17.637
of what happens to them.

